Handed off `TASK-260715-1ozsb6` to review; status is `to-review`, checklist 13/13.

Implemented in [LibSSH2Transport.swift](/Users/iv/Developer/relux-tunnel/Sources/ReluxTunnelLibSSH2Adapter/LibSSH2Transport.swift):

- Operation-scoped read/write cancellation and timeouts.
- Deadline-aware channel opens during rekey.
- Coalesced connection-global rekey with detachable callers.
